1
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,670
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:12,210
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,380
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:18,970
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,950
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:26,370
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,330
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:29,860
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:31,350
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:33,210
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,200
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,810
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:38,260
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:42,460
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,460
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:49,080
Didn't they say he was assassinated?

17
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:50,360
No.

18
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:52,200
The young master died
in the governor's bedroom.

19
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:53,880
The governor's guards carried
the body out.

20
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:57,680
(He could even kill a son
he'd raised for 20 years.)

21
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,520
(If he finds out I lied to him...)

22
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:02,640
Yanyan.

23
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:06,440
Come. Sit down.

24
00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:10,040
Dr. Liang.

25
00:01:10,040 --> 00:01:11,640
Check Lady Feng's pulse.

26
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:16,560
Here.

27
00:01:21,380 --> 00:01:24,180
=Episode 10=

28
00:01:25,160 --> 00:01:26,840
Why do you look so pale?

29
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:30,000
Was I too harsh with you that day?

30
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,080
Did I frighten you?

31
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:32,480
No.

32
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:34,720
Good. Good.

33
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:42,200
Governor.

34
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:43,520
Lady Feng

35
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:45,160
and the baby are both doing well.

36
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,280
Good.

37
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:47,720
You may go.

38
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:52,040
Yanyan.

39
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:54,720
At least you've come through for me.

40
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,400
I believe very soon,

41
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:57,880
I, the Governor,

42
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,840
will welcome the true young master

43
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:02,560
to the Governor's Residence.

44
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:05,800
(No.)

45
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:06,800
(I can't put this off any longer.)

46
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:08,160
(I have to do something.)

47
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:11,680
Governor.

48
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:14,600
You don't blame me
for falsely accusing Ms. Lu?

49
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,280
You were only looking out for me.

50
00:02:16,760 --> 00:02:17,920
How could I blame you?

51
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,960
You say you don't blame me,

52
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:21,800
but you still won't let me out.

53
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:23,920
Fair enough.

54
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:27,680
I'll give the order shortly.

55
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:30,160
You may come and go as you please.

56
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:32,040
But remember,

57
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:34,920
your health comes first.

58
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:38,960
Governor.

59
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:42,280
(Governor's Residence, Two Months Later)
What exactly was said?

60
00:02:42,320 --> 00:02:43,280
No one knows.

61
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:45,080
Iron Leopard's quarters

62
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,040
were heavily guarded.

63
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:48,840
We only know Lady Feng
went in with two girls.

64
00:02:49,320 --> 00:02:51,840
One was Xu Lili,
whom the young master had brought in.

65
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,280
I found out who the other one was too.

66
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:54,200
Her name was Rong.

67
00:02:54,320 --> 00:02:55,840
She used to do odd jobs at the theater

68
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:56,840
and knew Ms. Lu,

69
00:02:57,360 --> 00:03:00,040
as well as Lin Kefu, the real daughter.

70
00:03:01,880 --> 00:03:03,080
If that's the case,

71
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:06,440
we can guess what they told him.

72
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:09,320
Where are those two girls now?

73
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:11,720
The governor had them shot.

74
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:17,080
Two more innocent lives lost.

75
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:19,000
If Lady Feng really was the one

76
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:21,480
who exposed Ms. Lu's true identity,

77
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:23,680
knowing how the governor operates,

78
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:25,160
why would he keep her around,

79
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:26,920
let alone keep her as his daughter?

80
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:28,840
Don't you find that strange?

81
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:29,720
Maybe

82
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:31,920
she's just that good.

83
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,360
And now,

84
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:37,880
all the firms Lu Shaoyun once managed

85
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:40,520
will probably be hers soon.

86
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,160
Believe it or not,

87
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:45,880
the coffin they buried was empty.

88
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:47,560
The governor
had the young master's body

89
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:50,440
thrown into the river to feed the fish.

90
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:52,720
So he really wasn't assassinated.

91
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:54,960
Whatever the reason,

92
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,560
he raised him for 20 years.

93
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:58,120
Even a tiger won't eat its own cub.

94
00:03:58,480 --> 00:03:59,560
How could he bring himself to do that?

95
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:01,840
He must've really crossed the governor.

96
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:04,080
He wasn't even left a body to bury.

97
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,920
Even those 11 concubines
fared better than him.

98
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,000
Exactly.

99
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:10,640
At least those women
have memorial tablets.

100
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:14,120
Why did you kill them?

101
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:15,280
They wouldn't obey.

102
00:04:15,920 --> 00:04:17,120
Of course they had to be replaced.

103
00:04:18,520 --> 00:04:19,640
(Strange.)

104
00:04:20,080 --> 00:04:21,760
(Lu Zhentian had those women killed.)

105
00:04:22,280 --> 00:04:23,400
(Why didn't He Jingchen deny it?)

106
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:24,920
You know,

107
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:26,520
the Second Concubine
was the most resourceful.

108
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:28,880
She was the only one who got away.

109
00:04:28,880 --> 00:04:29,680
I heard

110
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:32,280
she found out the governor had secretly

111
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:33,680
killed her parents so he could have her.

112
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:35,760
If she hadn't already been

113
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:37,160
pregnant with his daughter then,

114
00:04:37,160 --> 00:04:37,680
she probably would've...

115
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:38,080
Shh.

116
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,480
Watch what you say.

117
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,480
Someone might hear you.

118
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:44,360
That daughter
is the governor's only child now.

119
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:45,920
Maybe not for long.

120
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:48,040
Isn't Lady Feng pregnant now?

121
00:04:51,320 --> 00:04:52,960
(So the Second Concubine who escaped)

122
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:54,560
(was Kefu's mother,)

123
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,600
(the owner of that bracelet.)

124
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,040
That's for stealing buns!

125
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:58,480
That's what you get for stealing!

126
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:00,160
I didn't mean to.

127
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,680
I was just hungry.

128
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:03,120
Hungry?

129
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,200
Who gets enough to eat?

130
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:05,320
Tell me. Who gets enough to eat?

131
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:06,160
Who does?

132
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:06,960
Master.

133
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:08,920
Didn't you say

134
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:11,120
magic takes two people working together?

135
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:13,280
I want her to be my partner.

136
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:14,400
Still won't talk?

137
00:05:14,520 --> 00:05:15,080
I'll make you talk!

138
00:05:15,080 --> 00:05:15,880
Stop!

139
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:17,720
Who are you?

140
00:05:19,880 --> 00:05:20,680
Her.

141
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:21,640
I'm taking her with me.

142
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:26,160
What is this, a beggar's handout?

143
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:28,200
She's one of the virgin girls
we raised at Yingchun Brothel.

144
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:29,280
Say something!

145
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:31,280
Don't think I won't hit you
just because someone's here.

146
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:33,680
Master.

147
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:35,240
Kefu.

148
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:37,200
This is your mother's keepsake.

149
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:38,480
Can you really part with it?

150
00:05:44,840 --> 00:05:45,640
I can.

151
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:50,240
You should've brought that out sooner.

152
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:51,800
You want the girl?

153
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:53,280
Go.

154
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,480
(Kefu.)

155
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,760
(Back then,
you used your mother's keepsake)

156
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:58,720
(to get me out of Yingchun Brothel.)

157
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:01,560
(And now I've learned)

158
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:04,080
(how Lu Zhentian murdered
your mother's parents.)

159
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:07,000
(If your mother hadn't escaped,)

160
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:10,200
(she might've become one of those
memorial tablets in the back courtyard.)

161
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:14,240
(And if Lu Zhentian hadn't enabled
Lu Shaoyun,)

162
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:16,800
(you wouldn't have died at his hands.)

163
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:18,280
(Don't worry.)

164
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:20,120
(I'm not leaving yet.)

165
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:21,360
(Revenge)

166
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,440
(isn't something you leave half done.)

167
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:26,200
(But in the Governor's Residence,)

168
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:27,640
(you don't kill with a gun.)

169
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:28,600
(You use your head.)

170
00:06:29,400 --> 00:06:30,600
(Most importantly,)

171
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,360
(I can't fight this alone.)

172
00:06:32,520 --> 00:06:34,480
(Since I chose to oppose Lu Zhentian,)

173
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:37,400
(I have to keep pretending
He Jingchen and I are allies.)

174
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:38,860
♪Boundless♪

175
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,040
Jingchen.

176
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:48,800
You finally came to see me.

177
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:56,680
You knew she was my pawn,

178
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:59,520
yet you brought people to the old man
to expose her.

179
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,720
Ruining her meant ruining me

180
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:04,600
and yourself.

181
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:06,880
So what if it did?

182
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:08,680
There's nothing in here now.

183
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:09,880
In less than two months,

184
00:07:09,880 --> 00:07:10,960
I'll be ruined anyway.

185
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:12,360
I gave you a chance
to fake a miscarriage.

186
00:07:12,760 --> 00:07:14,080
You wouldn't cooperate.

187
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:15,680
And now you're scared?

188
00:07:15,840 --> 00:07:17,160
Why are you being so harsh with me?

189
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:18,320
Before,

190
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,920
you never treated me like this.

191
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:22,000
Ever since she arrived,

192
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:23,160
you've changed.

193
00:07:23,840 --> 00:07:25,480
And you still say you don't like her.

194
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:30,920
Now the old man likes her too.

195
00:07:31,400 --> 00:07:33,360
He doesn't even care
whether she's really his daughter.

196
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:34,800
I'd say

197
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:35,960
your next move

198
00:07:36,880 --> 00:07:39,360
is to become the Governor's son-in-law.

199
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:41,840
Remember this.

200
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:44,320
Because of you,

201
00:07:44,880 --> 00:07:46,920
two more innocent girls are dead.

202
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:51,000
I didn't kill them.

203
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:52,360
Why are you blaming me?

204
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:53,560
You didn't kill them yourself,

205
00:07:54,400 --> 00:07:55,960
but they died because of you.

206
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:57,960
Lady Feng.

207
00:07:57,960 --> 00:07:58,840
I got it.

208
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:18,920
You're sure this is
Yingchun Brothel's secret aphrodisiac?

209
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:19,840
Absolutely.

210
00:08:19,960 --> 00:08:20,680
Any man

211
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:22,400
who takes this

212
00:08:22,400 --> 00:08:23,440
will go wild with lust.

213
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,160
From today on,

214
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:34,200
you're commander of the Lu Army's
Fifth Army.

215
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:37,120
I won't let you down, Governor.

216
00:08:40,640 --> 00:08:41,440
Rise.

217
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,240
Commander He.

218
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:52,000
(Today is a day to celebrate.)

219
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,360
(Relax and enjoy yourselves.)

220
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,360
(Drink up.)

221
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:56,120
(With the governor leading the Lu Army,)

222
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,120
(and Commander He beside him,)

223
00:08:57,160 --> 00:08:58,360
(we'll be unstoppable!)

224
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,560
(Come on.)

225
00:08:59,640 --> 00:09:00,440
(Let's drink!)

226
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:04,920
Commander He.

227
00:09:05,520 --> 00:09:06,360
Congratulations.

228
00:09:06,560 --> 00:09:07,080
Cheers.

229
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:08,120
Cheers.

230
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:18,320
On a day like this,

231
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:20,240
not drinking would look suspicious.

232
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:21,920
A few drinks won't hurt.

233
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:23,480
Worst case,
you can sleep at the barracks.

234
00:09:24,760 --> 00:09:25,560
I need to go back.

235
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:28,600
The one at home is no pushover.

236
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:30,720
Her?

237
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:33,760
Ms. Lu is completely focused
on the chamber of commerce.

238
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:35,200
What's there to worry about?

239
00:09:35,520 --> 00:09:37,120
Lady Feng, on the other hand,

240
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,280
you should watch out for.

241
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:40,640
(Commander He.)

242
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:42,320
All right. Keep drinking.

243
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:43,280
Come on.

244
00:09:43,760 --> 00:09:44,200
Cheers.

245
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:46,720
What did He Jingchen do

246
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:48,800
to get promoted to commander so quickly?

247
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:49,960
What could he have done?

248
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:51,840
The old man's lost his son

249
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:53,480
and probably wants him as his godson.

250
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:55,280
Isn't there already a baby on the way?

251
00:09:56,160 --> 00:09:57,200
But if you ask me,

252
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:58,960
that pregnancy seems fishy too.

253
00:09:59,640 --> 00:10:02,240
Nothing happened all this time,

254
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,640
then the young master dies,

255
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:04,720
and suddenly she's pregnant.

256
00:10:12,560 --> 00:10:13,480
I heard

257
00:10:13,800 --> 00:10:16,760
he's also gotten pretty close to Ms. Lu.

258
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:19,320
You just

259
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:22,200
don't have He Jingchen's looks.

260
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:55,000
Governor.

261
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,440
Adjutant He has been promoted.

262
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,520
If you need anything from now on,

263
00:10:59,520 --> 00:11:01,040
you can leave it to me.

264
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:03,280
No need.

265
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:04,560
Go about your work.

266
00:11:04,920 --> 00:11:05,720
You don't need to wait on me.

267
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:09,000
Yes.

268
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,400
Then I'll leave you to it.

269
00:11:21,380 --> 00:11:24,580
(Governor's Residence)

270
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:41,400
Did you put it in?

271
00:11:41,640 --> 00:11:42,440
Don't worry, Lady Feng.

272
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:43,120
The doctor said

273
00:11:43,160 --> 00:11:44,200
with this helping things along,

274
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:45,160
one time should get you pregnant.

275
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:53,360
(So Lady Feng's pregnancy was fake.)

276
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:23,490
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

277
00:12:25,150 --> 00:12:28,490
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

278
00:12:28,490 --> 00:12:31,110
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

279
00:12:32,630 --> 00:12:34,190
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

280
00:12:34,190 --> 00:12:38,310
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

281
00:12:38,870 --> 00:12:44,270
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

282
00:12:45,870 --> 00:12:49,190
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

283
